        "66232a31-cb5f-4a67-97cf-d0377bb2fac6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How To Use",
            "content": "<ol><li><strong>Preparation<\/strong>: If your skin is dry, lightly spritz with 7E Wellness <a href=\"https:\/\/www.7ewellness.com\/products\/replenish-hydrating-conducting-spritzer-8-oz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.7ewellness.com\/products\/replenish-hydrating-conducting-spritzer-8-oz\">Replenish Spritzer<\/a> or apply a non-irritating water-based serum.<\/li><li><strong>Attachment<\/strong>: Peel the plastic backing from the mask and connect it to your MyoLift™ device using the provided lead wire splitters.<\/li><li><strong>Application<\/strong>: Place the mask over the eye area, ensuring proper contact with the skin.<\/li><li><strong>Settings<\/strong>: Use the Educate or Erase setting on your device, adjusting the frequency as needed.<\/li><li><strong>Duration<\/strong>: Follow the recommended treatment time as per your device's guidelines.<\/li><\/ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Reduces Fine Lines and Wrinkles<\/strong>: Targets aging signs around the eyes and forehead.<\/li><li><strong>Stimulates Collagen and Elastin Production<\/strong>: Enhances skin elasticity and firmness.<\/li><li><strong>Improves Skin Tone and Texture<\/strong>: Promotes a smoother and more youthful complexion.<\/li><li><strong>Convenient and Easy to Use<\/strong>: Ideal for at-home treatments.<\/li><li><strong>Cost-Effective<\/strong>: Reusable design offers multiple treatments per mask<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "c470f05f-1b5f-4fc2-8e60-fc45d6f483ed": {
